    "background_story": "Amelia was a brilliant engineer who had always been fascinated by sustainable energy solutions. Growing up, she witnessed her family struggle with the environmental impact of disposable batteries in their rural home. Determined to make a difference, Amelia dedicated her career to developing innovative rechargeable technologies. Her breakthrough invention, the 'EcoCell,' was a game-changer - a rechargeable battery that could be powered by solar energy and lasted up to 10 times longer than traditional batteries. Amelia's creation revolutionized the way people lived and worked off the grid, providing a reliable and eco-friendly source of power. As her company grew, Amelia continued to push the boundaries of rechargeable technology, inspiring a new generation of engineers and entrepreneurs to join her in the pursuit of a more sustainable future.",
